            <ArticleTitle>Complete Genome Sequence of the Novel Bacteriophage pSco-10 Infecting Staphylococcus cohnii.</ArticleTitle>
            <ELocationID EIdType="pii" ValidYN="Y">e01032-17</ELocationID>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.1128/genomeA.01032-17</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Herein, we report the complete genome sequence of the Staphylococcus Myoviridae phage pSco-10 infecting Staphylococcus cohnii The phage pSco-10 was isolated from duck feces collected from four farms in South Korea. The current report provides valuable information for genomic study of phages.</AbstractText>
